This directory adapts small, specific vulnerability patterns (a handful
of lines each) from ScaleSec/vulnado, used under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:

  https://github.com/ScaleSec/vulnado
  Copyright 2020 ScaleSec
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

Specifically adapted:
  - The JWT issue/verify pattern (secret pulled from a config value via
    @Value, used to sign/verify tokens) — see AuthUtil.java, originally
    vulnado's User.token() / User.assertAuth().
  - The unsalted MD5 password check on login — see LoginController.java,
    originally vulnado's Postgres.md5() / LoginController.

All code in this directory has been rewritten around Northbound
Analytics' own domain (reports, not comments/cows) and none of
vulnado's other exercises (XSS, SSRF, RCE/reverse shell) or its React
client are used here.
